{
  "id": "p30",
  "title": "The Night at the Grain Port",
  "titleZh": "粮食港之夜",
  "topic": "港口事故与调查",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "A sudden incident begins with an explosion and a helicopter call.",
        "zh": "一场突发事件始于一次爆炸和一通直升机呼叫。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My father says tall piles of grain wait along the quiet shore.",
        "zh": "我父亲说，高高的金色粮堆在安静的海岸边等待。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A fierce wind may sink the damaged ship before dawn.",
        "zh": "一阵狂风可能会在天亮前让受损的船沉没。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My uncle saw a hot engine and a broken wire first.",
        "zh": "我叔叔最先看到发烫的发动机和断裂的电线。"
      },
      {
        "en": "For a decade, port construction has grown along this quiet coast.",
        "zh": "十年来，港口建设在这片安静的海岸上不断发展。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then the reserve tank holds the exact amount of fuel.",
        "zh": "然后备用油箱里装着恰好那么多的燃料。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The concept is simple, but the hidden danger is apparent.",
        "zh": "这个概念很简单，但隐藏的危险很明显。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An academic team offers assistance with the long report.",
        "zh": "一个学术团队为这份长篇报告提供协助。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A retired farmer now teaches agriculture at the school.",
        "zh": "一位退休农民现在在学校教农业。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A literary prize sits beside an antique wooden writing desk.",
        "zh": "一座文学奖杯放在一张古董木写字桌旁。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "There is nowhere to hide and no easy bargain to make.",
        "zh": "无处可藏，也没有什么便宜可捡。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The accident is a significant opportunity for real change.",
        "zh": "这场事故是一次真正改变的绝佳机会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The busy port handles a highly valuable volume of trade.",
        "zh": "繁忙的港口处理着数量极大、价值很高的贸易。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A liberal policy, for instance, may help the small boats.",
        "zh": "例如，一项宽松的政策可能会帮助那些小船。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My editor will retain the name and the weekly publication.",
        "zh": "我的编辑将保留这个名字和每周的出版物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A gap in the gene map explains the weak new seed.",
        "zh": "基因图谱中的一个缺口解释了这种弱小的新种子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later their competitive spirit and enthusiasm impress the town.",
        "zh": "后来，他们的竞争精神和热情让全镇印象深刻。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A psychological portrait of the captain fills the front page.",
        "zh": "一幅关于船长的心理画像占据了头版。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The rescue is a triumph, not a dump of old tired excuses.",
        "zh": "这次救援是一次胜利，而不是一堆老掉牙的借口。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A prior plan for new housing now looks too slow.",
        "zh": "先前的新住房计划现在看起来太慢了。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "One broken chip may undermine the whole control system.",
        "zh": "一块坏掉的芯片可能破坏整个控制系统。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later, given the cost, they peg the ticket price at ten pounds.",
        "zh": "后来，考虑到成本，他们把票价定在十英镑。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They exchange old paper notes for cash at the port office.",
        "zh": "他们在港务办公室用旧纸币兑换现金。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A public institution will benefit from the clear new rules.",
        "zh": "一家公共机构将从这些明确的新规则中受益。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Dark smoke surrounds the ship, and one small boat disappears.",
        "zh": "浓烟包围着船，一只小船消失了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A powerful diplomat visits the port before the weekend.",
        "zh": "一位有权势的外交官在周末前来港口。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A political crisis brings an interim team and a young democrat.",
        "zh": "一场政治危机带来了一个临时团队和一位年轻的民主人士。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A detective, port security, and the press meet at noon.",
        "zh": "一位侦探、港口安保和媒体在中午会面。"
      }
    ]
  ],
